# A captured session from a real Project Zomboid dedicated server, not
# documentation. Steam ids and player names are replaced with fixtures:
# the repo is not the place for a real operator's identifiers.
#
# Note what is absent. There are no join, leave or chat lines here, and
# that is not an editing choice — the server writes those to user.txt and
# chat.txt inside the data volume and they never reach stdout. It is why
# this game implements games.Rostered.

